    "_note": "ki: gained by the blocker. stopTicks: the hit-stop on the block. windows: the last ticks of the wind-up in which a fresh guard press is a perfect block, by strike class (moveset-rules.md section 11(f)); an opener and a blast depend on the exchange's weight; a class not listed has no window. early: ticks before the window opens in which a press still counts, by class. oneArmedOff: ticks off every window for a blocker with a broken arm. The lockout and the assist factor are Controls' (data/input/timing.json perfectBlock antiMashLockout, assistFactor). Touch's 2 extra ticks need the slot's layout in the sim and are not applied yet"
